with the environment is key to mastering the puzzles on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283790/extras/d40577fe24b568abb027f06c71e90f98.poster.avif?t=1755113601\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283790/extras/d40577fe24b568abb027f06c71e90f98.webm?t=1755113601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283790/extras/d40577fe24b568abb027f06c71e90f98.mp4?t=1755113601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283790/extras/9ca0c62d7bd3abf4b736b3cb792e8737.avif?t=1755113601\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 300 creatures, including special variants, and build out your Bestiary. Every creature you bond with strengthens your party and unlocks new possibilities for solving puzzles and progressing through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283790/extras/044fee7743bcf047259f4fc45ece8713.poster.avif?t=1755113601\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283790/extras/044fee7743bcf047259f4fc45ece8713.webm?t=1755113601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283790/extras/044fee7743bcf047259f4fc45ece8713.mp4?t=1755113601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai